      "description": "Ollama-routed models. NOTE: OpenCode exposes an 'ollama-cloud' provider, not a plain on-device 'ollama' provider -- these run on Ollama's hosted tier, not the local daemon. A truly on-device profile needs a custom provider entry in opencode.json and is deliberately not seeded here rather than faked. OpenCode-only for the same reason as open_models.",
